	(text "Green LED resistor value calculations:\nLED forward voltage = 3.2V\n3.2 * 3 = 9.6V (3 in series)\nUsing Ohm's law,\n12-9.6V = 2.4V\nThe LED's max current draw is 50 mA.\n2.4V / 0.04 amps = 60 ohms\n"
